# AI-ASSISTED: example environment; copy to .env and adjust.
# The development Redis that `make up` starts (127.0.0.1:6381, no password, local only).
# The tests never use it: each run starts its own Redis, or uses REDIS_URL when CI sets it,
# and they refuse a REDIS_URL on port 6381.
REDIS_URL=redis://127.0.0.1:6381/0
